 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### engine/video-state — `implemented`
+
+- A server error ack to one of our `<video>` state stanzas (the stanza's `id`
+  is remembered) no longer ends the call: only our video stops (`localVideo`
+  and the gate cleared, the sender disabled) and the call goes on. Live,
+  2026-11-21: a voice call of a call link turned to video ended 0.2 s after the
+  camera's first frame with `call rejected by server` (403), four times of
+  four, while its audio worked. Why the server refuses a link call's video
+  state is still unknown (needs a capture of WhatsApp Web doing it).
+
 ### api/call-link-join — `implemented`
 
 - Joining a call link builds the call entry as WhatsApp Web holds it after the
